---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - UnlockOps">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-base-50 dark:bg-base-950">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 mb-6">About UnlockOps</h1>

      <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-lg text-base-600 dark:text-base-400 mb-8">
          UnlockOps provides free developer tools and utilities to help developers build better applications faster.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-base-900 rounded-xl p-6 border border-base-200 dark:border-base-800 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-base-600 dark:text-base-400">
            We believe in making developer tools accessible to everyone. Our suite of free utilities helps developers, designers, and creators accomplish common tasks without needing to sign up or pay for premium services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-base-900 rounded-xl p-6 border border-base-200 dark:border-base-800 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 mb-4">What We Offer</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-base-600 dark:text-base-400">
            <li>✓ Weather lookup - Check weather for any city worldwide</li>
            <li>✓ Crypto prices - Live cryptocurrency market data</li>
            <li>✓ Developer utilities - QR codes, UUIDs, timestamps, and more</li>
            <li>✓ No signup required - Use tools instantly, no account needed</li>
            <li>✓ Privacy focused - We don't track or store your data</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-base-900 rounded-xl p-6 border border-base-200 dark:border-base-800">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 mb-4">Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-base-600 dark:text-base-400">
            Have suggestions for new tools or feedback on existing ones? We'd love to hear from you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>